{"product_id":"framed","title":"Framed","description":"\u003cp\u003eDylan's parents run the Snowdonia Oasis Auto Marvel garage - and when he's not trying to persuade his sisters to play football, Dylan is in charge of the petrol log. That means he gets to keep track of everyone coming in and out of Manod. This is an exploration of how art touches the life of one little boy.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 197\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Frank Cottrell Boyce\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781447265573\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 374\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45898400104601,"sku":"17RE-2-9781447265573","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/691821b30e787_Framed.jpg?v=1763202642","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/framed","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}